@Host = http://localhost:5022
@TenantId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@AppId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 1. List Seeded Notification Types (e.g. ORDER_SHIPPED)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/notification-types
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}

###

### 2. List Active Templates (verify per-channel templates)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/templates
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}

###

### 3. Send Multi-Channel Notification (Email + SMS + WhatsApp + SignalR + Webhook)
# @name sendMulti
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}
Idempotency-Key: test-multi-{{$guid}}

{
  "type": "ORDER_SHIPPED",
  "recipient": {
    "externalUserId": "cust-500",
    "email": "dina.adel.sobhi@gmail.com",
    "phone": "+201000000000",
    "webhookUrl": "http://localhost:5022/api/webhooks/receive-test"
  },
  "channels": [
    "Email",
    "Sms",
    "WhatsApp",
    "SignalR",
    "Webhook"
  ],
  "language": "en",
  "priority": "Normal",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "ORD-2026-001",
    "customerName": "Dina",
    "carrier": "Aramex",
    "trackingUrl": "https://aramex.com/track/ORD-2026-001"
  },
  "correlationId": "corr-ui-test-001"
}

###

### 4. Send WhatsApp Only (Green API)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}
Idempotency-Key: test-wa-{{$guid}}

{
  "type": "ORDER_SHIPPED",
  "recipient": {
    "externalUserId": "cust-500",
    "phone": "+201000000000"
  },
  "channels": [
    "WhatsApp"
  ],
  "language": "en",
  "priority": "High",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "ORD-WA-777",
    "customerName": "Dina",
    "carrier": "DHL",
    "trackingUrl": "https://dhl.com/track/ORD-WA-777"
  }
}

###

### 5. Send SMS Only (Vonage)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}
Idempotency-Key: test-sms-{{$guid}}

{
  "type": "ORDER_SHIPPED",
  "recipient": {
    "externalUserId": "cust-500",
    "phone": "+201000000000"
  },
  "channels": [
    "Sms"
  ],
  "language": "en",
  "priority": "High",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "ORD-SMS-888",
    "customerName": "Dina",
    "carrier": "FedEx",
    "trackingUrl": "https://fedex.com/track/ORD-SMS-888"
  }
}

###

### 6. Track Delivery Status & Attempts (uses notificationId from request #3)
@NotificationId = {{sendMulti.response.body.$.notificationId}}
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications/{{NotificationId}}/deliveries
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}

###

### 7. Inspect Received Webhooks (HMAC-SHA256 verified)
GET {{Host}}/api/webhooks/received

###

### 8. Clear Received Webhooks
POST {{Host}}/api/webhooks/clear

###

### 9. Create a Channel-Specific Template (Example: SMS for a NotificationType)
# Replace <TYPE_ID> with a real NotificationTypeDefinition ID from request #1
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/templates
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}

{
  "notificationTypeDefinitionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "channel": "Sms",
  "language": "en",
  "subject": null,
  "content": {
    "message": "Hi {{customerName}}, your order {{orderId}} shipped via {{carrier}}. Track: {{trackingUrl}}"
  },
  "variables": [
    "customerName",
    "orderId",
    "carrier",
    "trackingUrl"
  ]
}

###

### 10. Publish a Template
# Replace <TEMPLATE_ID> with the ID returned from request #9
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/templates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/publish
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-Application-Id: {{AppId}}
